      "reason": "These props are current render snapshots for AssistantPanelPlugin (runtime/selection/activity/history), not effect dependencies or component types; each includes live state/callbacks. There is no source-level remount or resource teardown on object identity. EmbeddedAgentAssistantPreview owns the assistant window session and side-panel geometry, while useEmbeddedAgentAssistantSession, AssistantPanelPlugin and window-workspace own transport/rendering/window resources. Settings/history/activity, viewport mode and persisted width are independent state axes. Effects synchronize external session, workspace, WebSocket and viewport lifecycles rather than simulate user handlers.",
